<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>All Mods - My Mod Minecraft</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }
        body {
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f1c2c, #928dab);
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 4px solid #00ff88;
        }
        header h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        .mod-card {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-left: 4px solid #00ff88;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }
        .mod-card h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #00ff88;
        }
        .mod-card p {
            color: #aaaaaa;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .download-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #005f73, #6a00ff);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.3s;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .download-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.02);
            opacity: 1;
        }
        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }
        .back-btn:hover {
            background-color: #555;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Available Mods</h1>
        <p>Browse and download our custom mods</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- کارت مود اول -->
        <div class="mod-card">
            <h2>Saffron & Rice Mod</h2>
            <p>Adds Persian food items like Saffron, Rice, Kabab, and Joojeh Kabab to your Minecraft world. Requires Forge 1.20.1.</p>
            
            <!-- دکمه دانلود آبی نفتی و بنفش -->
            <a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/panisaha/My_mod_mincrafte/main/Custom%20Hunger%20(world_template).mctemplate" class="download-btn">Download Saffron & Rice Mod</a>
        </div>

        <!-- دکمه بازگشت به صفحه اصلی -->
        <a href="index.html" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
